# Omens (battlefield.omens#helper, Navukgo Execution Chamber): Four players enter area 1: main (accepted, Prog 0), bob
# (completed), cat (accepted, Prog 1) and dan (accepted, Prog 2); eve (no quest) is refused with 32767 (the entry NPC's
# default, DefaultActions.lua). Only the registrant is held to Prog 0. An entry spawned IMMORTAL_FLAN+1 (first seen in
# the kill step's updates; the fake check pins that it is the fourth): killing IMMORTAL_FLAN does not win, killing +1
# gives the 32001 to all four (bob with the skip flag). The finish runs the quest's 32001 (Omens.cs): main's Prog 0 ->
# 1.
lists NavukgoExecutionChamber/_1s0/onTrigger NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventUpdate/32000 NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventFinish/32000 NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=NavukgoExecutionChamber pos=-598.5,8,-100 job=WAR lvl=75
